# Title: DotNet CLR DLL Loaded By Scripting Applications
# ID: 4508a70e-97ef-4300-b62b-ff27992990ea
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: omkar72, oscd.community
# Date: 2020-10-14
# Tags: attack.execution, attack.privilege-escalation, attack.stealth, attack.t1055
# Description: Detects .NET CLR DLLs being loaded by scripting applications such as wscript or cscript. This could be an indication of potential suspicious execution.
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

index=* eventtype=wineventlog ((process_path="*\\cmstp.exe" OR process_path="*\\cscript.exe" OR process_path="*\\mshta.exe" OR process_path="*\\msxsl.exe" OR process_path="*\\regsvr32.exe" OR process_path="*\\wmic.exe" OR process_path="*\\wscript.exe") AND (ImageLoaded="*\\clr.dll" OR ImageLoaded="*\\mscoree.dll" OR ImageLoaded="*\\mscorlib.dll"))
